                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for Andreas Dilger &amp;lt;adilger@dilger.ca&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/73f6b24c-cbb1-4992-9abc-ded89a90aca6" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/73f6b24c-cbb1-4992-9abc-ded89a90aca6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It looks like this started failing on 2026-05-11 after ZFS was updated to 2.4.0:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/search?horizon=2332800&amp;amp;status%5B%5D=FAIL&amp;amp;test_set_script_id=b890cfd0-bcad-11e1-9c6f-52540035b04c&amp;amp;sub_test_script_id=485c8048-dd90-11e1-85a8-52540035b04c&amp;amp;source=sub_tests#redirect" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/search?horizon=2332800&amp;amp;status%5B%5D=FAIL&amp;amp;test_set_script_id=b890cfd0-bcad-11e1-9c6f-52540035b04c&amp;amp;sub_test_script_id=485c8048-dd90-11e1-85a8-52540035b04c&amp;amp;source=sub_tests#redirect&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_10a failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;rm: cannot remove '/mnt/lustre/d8.sanity-scrub/mds1': Directory not empty
Fail to cleanup the env!
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

